        </exercise>
        <exercise id="_7cebc598-4f73-443a-8450-6d3665b575dd" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
            <para>When the price is \($45\) per ticket, what is the revenue in dollars?</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! The revenue is $1,800 when the price is $45 per ticket.</para>
