        </exercise>
        <exercise id="_962bc63e-e73d-47cd-9ec4-919394e898b7" class="multiple-choice">
          <problem>
            <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
            <para>When the price is \($50\) per ticket, what is the revenue in dollars?</para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! The revenue is zero when the price is $50 per ticket.</para>
